{
 "encounter_id": "00846",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "NURSE"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Doctor, this is Mr Ahmed, thirty-one, back from Karachi nine days ago, fever, abdominal pain, and he looks unwell. Obs done."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Doctor, I have a high fever, a terrible headache, and my tummy hurts. I think I ate some street food, chaat, in Karachi."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Mr Ahmed, I'm Dr Reid. Let's go through this carefully. When did the fever start?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Five days ago. It has gone up every evening, to about 39 or 40. And I feel so weak."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any diarrhoea, or constipation?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "First some diarrhoea. Now constipated."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Where is the tummy pain?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Around the belly button, and on the right."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any vomiting?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No vomiting. A little nausea."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any rash on your chest?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No rash."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any blood in the stool, or bleeding anywhere?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No blood."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Doctor, his observations. Temperature 39.2, pulse 84, blood pressure 108 over 66, oxygen 97 percent, respiratory rate 20.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you, Faith. Mr Ahmed, a slow pulse with a high fever is a clue. Did you have typhoid vaccination before the trip? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. I was born there, I thought I was immune. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any allergies to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No allergies."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you take any tablets?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Paracetamol, 1 gram, every six hours, for the fever."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What do you do for work?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm a chef."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me examine your tummy.",
   "pause": 18.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ahh, it hurts. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your tummy is tender in the lower right, and there's a mild fullness, and I can feel your spleen tip."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it appendicitis? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I don't think so. A prolonged fever rising each evening, a slow pulse for the temperature, abdominal pain, after travel to South Asia, and street food, makes me think of typhoid fever."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Typhoid? Is it serious? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It can be, but it's treatable with the right antibiotics. It needs blood cultures to confirm. I'd like to take blood cultures now, and a full set of blood tests, and a stool sample."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll set up the cultures, doctor. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And I'm going to send you to the infectious diseases ward today, to be admitted, so you can have intravenous antibiotics, and be monitored."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Admitted? How long? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A few days. Until the fever settles. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Will my family be at risk? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Typhoid can spread through contaminated food and water, so wash your hands thoroughly, don't prepare food for others, and don't share utensils."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'll be careful. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Faith will arrange the ward, and I'll see you there this evening."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
